ion would be yes, it can be passed through and it has to be passed through carefully and fairly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/15/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2018-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-02-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Vistar is having an outstanding year and grew its EBITDA by over 30% in the quarter through increases in the existing channels such as theater, retail and vending and strong results in the channels such as (inaudible).","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-02-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"The top line increase was driven by broad-based case growth across all our channels, most notably in our theater, retail, vending channels led by micro kitchen and micro markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"So we had some expense last year where we were training in Q2 these employees to get them ready into Vistar facilities while we were continuing to pay the same for that business done out of the acquisition buildings and then we had some severance to deal with.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-05-08","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"In theater, Vistar had a tough comparison versus last year's blockbuster hit Black Panther.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-05-08","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"As a result, we expect to see our theater business bounce back and perform better in our fiscal fourth quarter than it did in our fiscal third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-08-14","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"We witnessed strong case sales growth in the segments theatre, vending corrections, and retail channels and it was as a result of recent acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/14/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-08-14","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Theater, that's a big part of our business, but we're pretty much going to mirror the industry as far as growth goals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/14/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-08-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"To a degree, we like to see a price increase, we tend to make some money when that happens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/14/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2019 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-08-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Judah Frommer","x":"And then switching to kind of vest our expectations for the coming year, we did see some chocolate or candy price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/14/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-11-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George L Holm","x":"This increase was driven by the acquisition of Eby-Brown and sales growth in the segments of corrections, vending, theater and office coffee.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-11-06","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Marisa Sullivan","x":"And have you seen any changes in your theater business given the movie release calendar and performance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Mandeville","x":"…follow up really quickly, can you just remind us how that excise tax stamp flow through the P&L and then also -- you can correct me if I'm wrong here, but I believe there is going to be a 3rd cigarette price increase that takes place in calendar Q4, so should would be looking forward to that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George L Holm","x":"There have been some modest operating cost savings realized immediately post close.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-02-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"What we saw was a weak December in theater, part of it being kind of the product that was out there, and part of it being one less week between Thanksgiving and Christmas, which is typically the peak for theater going.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"I would say that when it came the dairy and meat, we probably had similar difficulty passing it through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"And I think that people are or our customers are very smart around how to get menu price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-05-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"We anticipate the challenges in the theater and concessions business to continue for the foreseeable future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-05-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Theater, an important channel to both Vistar and to PFG, represents about 15% of total Vistar sales excluding Eby-Brown, or 6% of Vistar and Eby-Brown combined.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-08-12","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"And particularly, we expect movie theaters to begin reopening over the next few weeks and the office coffee service base continues to be impacted by many people working from home.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-08-12","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"James Hope","x":"Still, given the current external environment, we are fully reserved for the theater channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-08-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Hope","x":"A hiring freeze we put in mid-February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2020 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-08-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"They've had to dig deeper from an expense standpoint, as far as rightsizing their business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-11-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"In particular, we continue to expect a very slow recovery at movie theaters, office coffee services, travel and hospitality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-11-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Theater is our low case cost area and that's all bucked and shut down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kelly Bania","x":"George, I'm sure you're aware that two of your largest competitors have identified pretty sizable permanent fixed cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-02-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"We continue to expect a much slower recovery in theater and office coffee services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-02-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"It is difficult to predict whether occupancy in movie theaters and professional offices will return to normal levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George L. Holm","x":"These channels have somewhat offset sizable declines in our theater and office coffee service businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George L. Holm","x":"And we're beginning to see signs of improvement as movie theaters begin to slowly reopen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q3","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James D. Hope","x":"On our independent -- our independent business, we'll do well, and we'll be able to pass it through fully.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-08-19","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"At Vistar, the recovery in movie theaters and office coffee remains slow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/19/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-08-19","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"We do expect theaters and office coffee to remain under pressure at least through the summer, as continued office closures and a slow build in theater persist.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/19/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-08-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"We not only passed it on per case profit, but we did it in actual margin as well in spite of the heavy inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/19/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2021 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-08-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Hope","x":"But all in, we feel very comfortable about how we're passing it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/19/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q4-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2022 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Even without a full recovery in theater and office coffee, Vistar results have improved dramatically.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2022 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"And recent box office trends have caused us to be optimistic about the future for that channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2022 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"While it is still early days, these operations allow us to tap into several exciting distribution opportunities, including customer fulfillment, direct-to-consumer e-commerce fulfillment and virtual warehousing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2022 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"John Glass","x":"You mentioned like DTC, I'm not sure if you've done that business before.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2022 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"And then if you go to more package-type product or further processed product, I think these companies fight pretty hard to get price increases through, and I do feel that -- and by the way, product is also extremely hard to get.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2022 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"The only thing that could happen is maybe those that do fairly frequent price increases or even annual price increases, they may not be as driven to do increases in the future if their input of products go down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/performance-food-group-company-pfgc-q1-2022-earnin/"},{"c":"PFGC 2025 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-08-13","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Our specialty business faced historically high prices across the candy and snack industry, high competition in the theater channel, and financial struggles for several customers in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/pfgc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2025 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Hatcher","x":"As a reminder, we source the majority of our inventory from domestic suppliers and therefore do not expect a material impact from tariff increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/pfgc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2025 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Edward Kelly","x":"But if we look out, we have tariff pricing that is starting to come in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/pfgc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2025 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-08-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"And, you know, they had to pass that on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/13/pfgc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Scott McPherson","x":"During the first quarter, Specialty's net sales declined 0.7% due to a challenging quarter for theater and value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/pfg-pfgc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"If you look at the margin aspect, our theater business has been down fairly substantially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/pfg-pfgc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Hatcher","x":"As a reminder, we source the majority of our inventory from domestic suppliers and therefore do not expect a material impact from tariff increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/pfg-pfgc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Karen Holthaus","x":"Your conversations with them that are getting you to mid-single-digit number contemplated how tariffs yeah, tariff-related inflation and more of, like, the packaging side of things might ultimately impact that number?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/pfg-pfgc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Holm","x":"Now if you look at inflation, you look at pre-COVID and you look at today, candy and snacks are way up close to the top as far as price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/pfg-pfgc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick Hatcher","x":"Honestly, a lot of the candy price increases, we've already seen those and other suppliers taking price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/pfg-pfgc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Scott McPherson","x":"Sales growth was tempered by another difficult quarter in theater, which was down over 30%, representing an approximate $50 million drag on overall sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/performance-food-group-pfgc-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q2","e":"pfgc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Scott McPherson","x":"Outside of theaters, specialty performed well, growing sales at a high single to low double-digit rate in the vending office coffee retail, campus, and travel channels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/performance-food-group-pfgc-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2026 Q4","e":"pfgc","d":"2026-08-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Edward Kelly","x":"And Scott, can I just ask you on the cost savings side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/performance-food-group-pfgc-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2027 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2026-11-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Scott McPherson","x":"We also saw a nice rebound in the movie theater space, which together with our concessions and hospitality business, make up the entertainment channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/pfg-pfgc-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2027 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2026-11-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Scott McPherson","x":"We expect the entertainment channel to remain robust in the upcoming quarter due to a strong movie slate hitting theaters later in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/pfg-pfgc-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PFGC 2027 Q1","e":"pfgc","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott McPherson","x":"Yeah, I think, if you think about the consumer, taking a step back a number of quarters, consumers faced tariff impacts, they've faced inflation, now th